58
00:08:03,008 --> 00:08:05,008
Oh man, I totally envy you right now.

59
00:08:05,008 --> 00:08:09,008
Look at the passion in his eyes. He's been saving it all up for you.

60
00:08:09,008 --> 00:08:12,008
He even called himself your lifelong rival.

61
