64
00:08:25,008 --> 00:08:35,008
You're late, Kiriyama. I was getting tired of waiting.

65
00:08:35,008 --> 00:08:40,008
I got here at the appointed time. You on the other hand are way too early.

66
00:08:40,008 --> 00:08:41,008
Geez.

67
00:08:41,008 --> 00:08:44,008
I see. I guess my enthusiasm got the best of me.

68
