That's it. That expression.

121
00:13:01,768 --> 00:13:05,548
It hasn't changed much since we were kids.

122
00:13:08,108 --> 00:13:09,448
Harunobu Nikaido.

123
00:13:10,808 --> 00:13:12,128
He's still the same.

124
00:13:13,168 --> 00:13:14,448
And I guess I am too.

125
00:13:14,448 --> 00:13:18,808
Stuck in the same small universe.

126
00:13:19,508 --> 00:13:21,248
