Mom!

258
00:20:51,448 --> 00:20:53,508
The lump in my throat was paralyzing.

259
00:20:54,688 --> 00:20:56,288
I couldn't even call out to her.

260
00:21:01,888 --> 00:21:06,148
All that time she held it in, hiding her pain from the others.

261
00:21:18,148 --> 00:21:24,788
It hurts, right?

262
00:21:28,308 --> 00:21:31,228
I'm sorry. I'll go back in a minute.

263
00:21:33,148 --> 00:21:35,948
Listening to her cry had a deep effect on me.

264
00:21:36,868 --> 00:21:41,488
The pain I had shut away began seeping back into my heart.

265
00:21:42,448 --> 00:21:45,068
Don't worry, okay?

